1
00:01:30,566 --> 00:01:31,551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

2
00:01:31,551 --> 00:01:33,560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

3
00:01:35,340 --> 00:01:38,940
=Episode 11=

4
00:01:40,740 --> 00:01:42,140
(Cuiyun Tower)
Sir, come in and have some fun!

5
00:01:43,860 --> 00:01:45,060
Sir! Come inside and...

6
00:01:47,260 --> 00:01:48,820
What did Yang Si say earlier?

7
00:01:49,140 --> 00:01:49,780
Take care, sir!

8
00:01:49,780 --> 00:01:51,300
Seducing the Princess

9
00:01:51,860 --> 00:01:53,940
while sneaking off to brothels
behind her back?

10
00:01:55,460 --> 00:01:56,180
My dear Yan Shang.

11
00:01:56,180 --> 00:01:57,140
Sir, please come in!

12
00:01:57,460 --> 00:02:00,140
I had no idea you
were trying to seduce me.

13
00:02:05,860 --> 00:02:06,780
Am I seeing things?

14
00:02:07,660 --> 00:02:08,580
You're blushing.

15
00:02:09,660 --> 00:02:10,340
What's on your mind?

16
00:02:13,100 --> 00:02:15,180
What were you thinking about just now,
Your Highness?

17
00:02:19,460 --> 00:02:19,940
Tonight,

18
00:02:20,740 --> 00:02:22,100
I noticed something interesting.

19
00:02:22,900 --> 00:02:23,900
Outside a private room upstairs,

20
00:02:24,540 --> 00:02:26,420
several men were pretending
to chat casually.

21
00:02:26,980 --> 00:02:28,140
But I recognized their bearing.

22
00:02:28,620 --> 00:02:29,980
They were clearly soldiers,

23
00:02:30,780 --> 00:02:32,340
probably from the frontier army.

24
00:02:35,620 --> 00:02:36,380
Then that private room

25
00:02:36,780 --> 00:02:38,540
probably held a high-ranking officer
in disguise.

26
00:02:41,140 --> 00:02:42,140
Even more interestingly,

27
00:02:42,740 --> 00:02:44,900
Yang Si entered that room too.

28
00:02:49,940 --> 00:02:50,740
I have a theory,

29
00:02:51,340 --> 00:02:52,580
but I can't verify it just yet.

30
00:02:53,380 --> 00:02:55,100
Perhaps I'll get the chance later.

31
00:02:57,140 --> 00:03:01,900
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

32
00:03:01,900 --> 00:03:02,940
Has Yan Shang gone to see
the exam results?

33
00:03:03,500 --> 00:03:04,140
Not yet.

34
00:03:05,580 --> 00:03:07,020
He certainly has patience.

35
00:03:08,660 --> 00:03:09,820
Yan Shang isn't worried,

36
00:03:09,820 --> 00:03:10,540
but you seem to be.

37
00:03:13,900 --> 00:03:14,700
Forgive me, Your Highness.

38
00:03:15,860 --> 00:03:17,020
Why would I be worried?

39
00:03:18,460 --> 00:03:19,740
Even if luck isn't on his side,

40
00:03:20,460 --> 00:03:22,020
I still have Wei Shu,
the future top scholar.

41
00:03:22,940 --> 00:03:23,820
That's different.

42
00:03:24,620 --> 00:03:26,140
If Wei Shu failed the exams,

43
00:03:26,420 --> 00:03:28,540
you wouldn't go out in the middle
of the night looking for a solution.

44
00:03:29,660 --> 00:03:30,580
Chunhua.

45
00:03:31,020 --> 00:03:32,140
Are you asking for a beating?

46
00:03:34,660 --> 00:03:35,900
Wei Shu won't fail.

47
00:03:38,780 --> 00:03:39,220
Your Highness,

48
00:03:40,020 --> 00:03:41,860
if you're really so curious
about the results,

49
00:03:42,100 --> 00:03:43,180
why don't I go check for you?

50
00:03:46,180 --> 00:03:46,740
Tell me.

51
00:03:48,060 --> 00:03:49,020
Why do you want to see the results?

52
00:03:51,300 --> 00:03:52,420
Liu Wenji said

53
00:03:52,740 --> 00:03:53,620
if he passes the exams,

54
00:03:54,020 --> 00:03:54,580
he'll marry me.

55
00:03:56,740 --> 00:03:57,060
Go on.

56
00:03:59,580 --> 00:04:00,220
Thank you, Your Highness.

57
00:04:06,460 --> 00:04:07,020
(Chunhua,)

58
00:04:07,740 --> 00:04:08,860
(I'm afraid your wedding)

59
00:04:09,940 --> 00:04:10,940
(will have to wait a little longer.)

60
00:04:14,140 --> 00:04:15,300
(Examination Hall)
(I passed! I passed!)

61
00:04:15,340 --> 00:04:15,900
(Imperial Examination Results)
(Come take a look!)

62
00:04:16,100 --> 00:04:17,780
(I made the list! There's my name!)

63
00:04:17,940 --> 00:04:19,580
(Thirteen, Mr. Bai! Thirteen!)

64
00:04:20,340 --> 00:04:21,180
(I didn't pass.)

65
00:04:21,460 --> 00:04:22,300
(Excellent! Well done!)

66
00:04:22,740 --> 00:04:23,500
(We all made the list!)

67
00:04:23,500 --> 00:04:24,020
I made the list!

68
00:04:24,020 --> 00:04:24,700
(Not bad! Well done!)

69
00:04:24,700 --> 00:04:25,460
I made the list!

70
00:04:25,900 --> 00:04:27,420
I passed!

71
00:04:29,180 --> 00:04:29,740
(Sixteen!)

72
00:04:29,740 --> 00:04:30,260
(I passed!)

73
00:04:30,460 --> 00:04:30,940
(We all made it!)

74
00:04:30,940 --> 00:04:31,580
(I passed!)

75
00:04:31,580 --> 00:04:32,140
(We all made it!)

76
00:04:32,140 --> 00:04:33,100
(I passed!)

77
00:04:36,620 --> 00:04:36,980
(Wei Shu!)

78
00:04:37,100 --> 00:04:37,900
- (Wei Shu came first!)
- (Look!)

79
00:04:37,900 --> 00:04:38,260
(Wei Shu!)

80
00:04:38,500 --> 00:04:39,140
(2nd: Li Wenqing; 3rd: Yan Shang)
(Who's Wei Shu?)

81
00:04:39,860 --> 00:04:40,860
(1st: Wei Shu)
(That's Wei Shu!)

82
00:04:40,860 --> 00:04:41,900
(1st: Wei Shu)

83
00:04:42,500 --> 00:04:43,300
- (Congratulations!)
- (Congratulations, Wei Shu!)

84
00:04:43,300 --> 00:04:43,980
(Congratulations! Congratulations!)

85
00:04:44,220 --> 00:04:45,140
- (Congratulations!)
- (Congratulations, Wei Shu!)

86
00:04:45,140 --> 00:04:46,260
(Congratulations, Wei Shu!)

87
00:04:46,260 --> 00:04:47,460
- (Such a brilliant young scholar!)
- (Congratulations, Wei Shu!)

88
00:04:47,460 --> 00:04:48,300
- (Incredible!)
- (Wei Shu!)

89
00:04:48,300 --> 00:04:49,220
- (Congratulations!)
- (Wei Shu!)

90
00:04:49,220 --> 00:04:49,820
(Amazing, Wei Shu!)

91
00:04:49,820 --> 00:04:50,540
(Congratulations, Wei Shu!)

92
00:04:50,540 --> 00:04:52,380
- (Wei Shu!)
- (Wei Shu, congratulations!)

93
00:04:52,500 --> 00:04:53,220
(Congratulations!)

94
00:04:53,380 --> 00:04:53,740
(Wei Shu!)

95
00:04:54,300 --> 00:04:54,700
(Wei Shu!)

96
00:04:57,100 --> 00:04:58,100
(Examination Hall)

97
00:04:58,100 --> 00:04:59,100
(You owe us all a feast!)

98
00:04:59,660 --> 00:05:00,580
(Wei Shu! Wait!)

99
00:05:02,460 --> 00:05:02,940
(Wei Shu.)

100
00:05:02,940 --> 00:05:04,020
(Congratulations, Wei Shu!)

101
00:05:10,860 --> 00:05:12,580
(I'm number eighteen! I passed too!)

102
00:05:12,820 --> 00:05:13,740
(Am I number seventeen?)

103
00:05:14,900 --> 00:05:15,820
(I passed too!)

104
00:05:16,820 --> 00:05:17,660
(I passed!)

105
00:05:20,060 --> 00:05:20,820
(Let me help you look.)

106
00:05:23,220 --> 00:05:25,220
(Examination Hall)

107
00:05:28,260 --> 00:05:29,300
(Better luck next year!)

108
00:05:33,740 --> 00:05:38,380
(1st: Wei Shu; 2nd: Li Wenqing;
3rd: Yan Shang; 4th: Wen Qingchen)

109
00:05:40,700 --> 00:05:42,700
(Examination Hall)

110
00:05:44,780 --> 00:05:45,580
Satisfied now?

111
00:05:47,580 --> 00:05:47,980
Thank you.

112
00:05:48,580 --> 00:05:49,220
Where's Guiniang?

113
00:05:50,460 --> 00:05:51,260
Give her back to me!

114
00:05:51,980 --> 00:05:52,660
I've lost everything.

115
00:05:52,660 --> 00:05:53,500
She's all I have left.

116
00:05:54,940 --> 00:05:55,420
Feng Xianyu,

117
00:05:56,580 --> 00:05:57,380
she...

118
00:05:57,980 --> 00:05:59,500
returned home with an old servant
yesterday.

119
00:06:00,260 --> 00:06:02,140
Didn't you personally see her off
at the city gate?

120
00:06:05,100 --> 00:06:06,220
(May the Realm Prosper)
What I said last night...

121
00:06:06,860 --> 00:06:07,660
I was bluffing.

122
00:06:08,340 --> 00:06:09,260
Guiniang is safe.

123
00:06:12,460 --> 00:06:13,420
You lied to me?

124
00:06:14,900 --> 00:06:15,260
Yes.

125
00:06:22,620 --> 00:06:23,700
I can't believe I fell for it.

126
00:06:28,140 --> 00:06:29,500
My guilty conscience

127
00:06:31,700 --> 00:06:33,220
made me fall for your trick.

128
00:06:34,980 --> 00:06:35,380
Feng Xianyu.

129
00:06:39,140 --> 00:06:40,340
What else do you have to say?

130
00:06:41,620 --> 00:06:42,580
Are you going to mock me

131
00:06:43,100 --> 00:06:43,980
or lecture me?

132
00:06:48,860 --> 00:06:51,140
Grand Princess Luling
always tires of her lovers.

133
00:06:51,340 --> 00:06:52,140
A man who relies on his looks

134
00:06:52,980 --> 00:06:54,020
can never keep her favor for long.

135
00:06:54,260 --> 00:06:56,060
And how is Princess Danyang
any different?

136
00:06:57,020 --> 00:06:58,620
How long will you and Wei Shu
stay in her favor?

137
00:06:59,380 --> 00:07:00,140
You have talent

138
00:07:00,660 --> 00:07:01,340
and ambition.

139
00:07:02,340 --> 00:07:04,180
Instead of flattering others
to win their favor,

140
00:07:05,180 --> 00:07:07,140
use your intelligence and abilities

141
00:07:07,820 --> 00:07:08,780
to earn your place in her household.

142
00:07:10,300 --> 00:07:13,300
Grand Princess Luling has wielded
unchecked power in Sheng'an for years.

143
00:07:13,820 --> 00:07:16,300
Yet she has few wise advisers
to guide her.

144
00:07:16,940 --> 00:07:17,860
She hasn't even secured a way out.

145
00:07:18,900 --> 00:07:20,260
If the political winds shift one day,

146
00:07:21,420 --> 00:07:22,780
she may not even
be able to save herself.

147
00:07:24,940 --> 00:07:26,060
We were classmates once.

148
00:07:27,780 --> 00:07:28,620
That's all I'll say.

149
00:07:30,260 --> 00:07:32,900
(May the Realm Prosper)

150
00:07:35,140 --> 00:07:36,900
(Examination Hall)
(Is my name there? Can you see it?)

151
00:07:38,940 --> 00:07:40,340
(How am I supposed to explain this?)

152
00:07:41,300 --> 00:07:42,300
(Am I number seventeen?)

153
00:07:42,300 --> 00:07:42,900
(I passed too!)

154
00:07:43,660 --> 00:07:44,180
(That's me!)

155
00:07:45,260 --> 00:07:46,060
(I passed!)

156
00:07:47,580 --> 00:07:48,740
(Why isn't his name there?)

157
00:07:48,940 --> 00:07:49,460
Yan Shang!

158
00:07:50,140 --> 00:07:50,900
Miss Chunhua.

159
00:07:51,580 --> 00:07:52,620
Is Her Highness here too?

160
00:07:53,540 --> 00:07:55,060
She's waiting for news at the residence.

161
00:07:55,300 --> 00:07:55,980
I came alone.

162
00:07:58,020 --> 00:07:58,540
Yan Shang,

163
00:07:58,980 --> 00:07:59,980
have you seen Liu Wenji?

164
00:08:00,660 --> 00:08:02,060
I've been waiting by the results board
all morning.

165
00:08:03,020 --> 00:08:04,580
But I couldn't find his name
on the list,

166
00:08:05,260 --> 00:08:06,140
and I haven't seen him either.

167
00:08:07,020 --> 00:08:07,860
I haven't seen him either.

168
00:08:08,700 --> 00:08:09,780
But Wenji would certainly come.

169
00:08:10,420 --> 00:08:11,060
I'm afraid

170
00:08:11,620 --> 00:08:12,620
he may have already seen the results

171
00:08:12,900 --> 00:08:13,660
and slipped away quietly.

172
00:08:14,380 --> 00:08:15,340
He might be avoiding us.

173
00:08:16,580 --> 00:08:17,540
Why would he avoid me?

174
00:08:19,620 --> 00:08:20,460
If he's upset,

175
00:08:20,460 --> 00:08:21,420
I could keep him company.

176
00:08:23,300 --> 00:08:24,500
He must feel terrible being alone.

177
00:08:26,180 --> 00:08:26,900
Where could he have gone?

178
00:08:28,940 --> 00:08:29,660
Miss Chunhua,

179
00:08:30,300 --> 00:08:30,900
don't worry.

180
00:08:31,380 --> 00:08:32,180
I'll help you find him.

181
00:08:32,700 --> 00:08:33,620
You check Yongshou Temple.

182
00:08:34,140 --> 00:08:35,020
I'll look elsewhere.

183
00:08:38,380 --> 00:08:41,220
(Examination Hall)

184
00:08:41,460 --> 00:08:43,140
All that effort, for nothing!

185
00:08:43,380 --> 00:08:44,500
What's the point of all this studying?

186
00:08:44,500 --> 00:08:45,340
(Congratulations, sir!)

187
00:08:45,780 --> 00:08:46,220
(Thank you!)

188
00:08:46,900 --> 00:08:48,700
- (Your writing is truly exceptional!)
- (You've made a name for yourself!)

189
00:08:48,900 --> 00:08:49,260
(Look!)

190
00:08:50,060 --> 00:08:50,860
(You must be so relieved!)

191
00:08:50,860 --> 00:08:51,300
(Failed again!)

192
00:08:51,300 --> 00:08:52,220
- (Failed again!)
- (I'm done with these exams!)

193
00:08:54,100 --> 00:08:55,380
Sorry, I mistook you for someone else.

194
00:09:10,500 --> 00:09:11,500
(I want another drink!)

195
00:09:12,140 --> 00:09:12,900
(All right, all right!)

196
00:09:13,580 --> 00:09:13,900
(Here!)

197
00:09:14,820 --> 00:09:15,420
(Failed again!)

198
00:09:21,100 --> 00:09:21,620
Waiter!

199
00:09:22,820 --> 00:09:24,340
Bring me your finest wine.

200
00:09:25,940 --> 00:09:27,180
I... I can pay!

201
00:09:38,100 --> 00:09:40,700
What's the fun in drinking alone?

202
00:09:41,060 --> 00:09:43,740
Why not let the two of us
keep you company?

203
00:09:45,860 --> 00:09:46,140
Get lost!

204
00:09:48,860 --> 00:09:50,100
Why get so angry, sir?

205
00:09:50,420 --> 00:09:52,500
Life is full of disappointments.

206
00:09:52,780 --> 00:09:54,580
Let us drink with you tonight

207
00:09:54,900 --> 00:09:55,820
and help you forget your troubles.

208
00:09:58,260 --> 00:09:59,060
Forget my troubles?

209
00:10:01,420 --> 00:10:02,780
You women of the pleasure house...

210
00:10:04,340 --> 00:10:06,540
What could you possibly
know of my sorrow?

211
00:10:15,340 --> 00:10:15,900
Then again...

212
00:10:18,300 --> 00:10:19,420
On a day like today,

213
00:10:20,740 --> 00:10:22,700
they're all celebrating their success.

214
00:10:24,300 --> 00:10:25,300
Apart from you two,

215
00:10:27,420 --> 00:10:29,180
who else could help me drown my sorrows?

216
00:10:31,420 --> 00:10:32,140
All right!

217
00:10:32,700 --> 00:10:34,300
Waiter! More wine!

218
00:10:38,780 --> 00:10:39,820
We've searched everywhere
we can think of.

219
00:10:40,140 --> 00:10:41,060
What if he does something foolish?

220
00:10:44,940 --> 00:10:45,340
Chunhua.

221
00:10:46,060 --> 00:10:46,660
You should head back.

222
00:10:46,940 --> 00:10:47,700
I'll keep looking.

223
00:10:48,020 --> 00:10:48,620
If I find any trace of him,

224
00:10:48,900 --> 00:10:49,500
I'll let you know.

225
00:10:50,220 --> 00:10:50,500
All right.

226
00:10:58,140 --> 00:10:59,420
Where will Yan Shang look for him?

227
00:11:04,580 --> 00:11:05,260
(I'm done with these exams!)

228
00:11:05,260 --> 00:11:05,660
(Unbelievable!)

229
00:11:05,660 --> 00:11:09,820
(Cuiyun Tower)

230
00:11:09,820 --> 00:11:10,660
Sir, you're back!

231
00:11:11,340 --> 00:11:13,420
Why isn't your wife with you this time?

232
00:11:13,700 --> 00:11:14,300
At a time like this,

233
00:11:14,540 --> 00:11:16,140
I imagine you have plenty of scholars
who failed the exams.

234
00:11:16,180 --> 00:11:16,860
(Zuiyue Tower)
More than you can count!

235
00:11:17,100 --> 00:11:18,260
It's the same every year
when the results come out.

236
00:11:20,060 --> 00:11:20,380
(Cuiyun Tower)
Right this way.

237
00:11:20,740 --> 00:11:21,900
(Careful, sir.)

238
00:11:21,900 --> 00:11:22,740
Watch your step.

239
00:11:23,460 --> 00:11:23,900
(Okay.)

240
00:11:24,900 --> 00:11:25,820
Pretty lady.

241
00:11:26,220 --> 00:11:26,860
Have a drink with me.

242
00:11:29,020 --> 00:11:30,020
- (Easy.)
- (Drink with me.)

243
00:11:36,060 --> 00:11:36,940
Excuse me. Coming through.

244
00:11:37,740 --> 00:11:38,420
(Careful.)

245
00:11:40,700 --> 00:11:41,660
(Come on! Let's drink!)

246
00:11:46,980 --> 00:11:48,420
(You can really hold your liquor.)

247
00:11:49,220 --> 00:11:50,020
(Have another!)

248
00:11:52,300 --> 00:11:55,140
(Sir, there's still plenty
left in your cup.)

249
00:11:55,340 --> 00:11:55,660
(Here.)

250
00:11:57,980 --> 00:11:58,380
Who is it?

251
00:11:58,820 --> 00:12:00,420
(Who's that?)

252
00:12:05,900 --> 00:12:07,060
Well, if it isn't our
third-place scholar.

253
00:12:07,540 --> 00:12:08,060
Liu Wenji.

254
00:12:09,100 --> 00:12:11,660
I'll pretend you're just talking
nonsense because you're drunk.

255
00:12:12,500 --> 00:12:12,860
What?

256
00:12:14,180 --> 00:12:14,820
Am I wrong?

257
00:12:16,380 --> 00:12:16,940
Aren't you

258
00:12:18,740 --> 00:12:19,900
the Third-Place Scholar?

259
00:12:21,060 --> 00:12:21,700
Isn't he?

260
00:12:22,820 --> 00:12:23,140
Come on.

261
00:12:23,580 --> 00:12:24,100
You're coming back with me.

262
00:12:24,460 --> 00:12:25,060
I'm not leaving.

263
00:12:25,700 --> 00:12:27,260
I'm having a wonderful time here.

264
00:12:34,820 --> 00:12:35,780
If Chunhua saw you like this,

265
00:12:36,620 --> 00:12:38,380
imagine how much it would hurt her.

266
00:12:48,220 --> 00:12:49,020
Chunhua?

267
00:12:54,820 --> 00:12:55,620
I can't marry her.

268
00:12:58,300 --> 00:12:59,460
Whether I pass the exams or not,

269
00:13:00,980 --> 00:13:01,780
I can never marry her.

270
00:13:06,420 --> 00:13:06,900
Come on.

271
00:13:07,940 --> 00:13:08,660
Have a drink with me.

272
00:13:13,300 --> 00:13:13,820
Liu Wenji!

273
00:13:27,340 --> 00:13:27,940
Liu Wenji.

274
00:13:29,260 --> 00:13:30,780
I waited for you by the results board
all day.

275
00:13:32,340 --> 00:13:34,020
And you came to this filthy place?

276
00:13:37,020 --> 00:13:37,380
Wenji.

277
00:13:44,700 --> 00:13:45,060
Wenji.

278
00:13:49,540 --> 00:13:50,180
Filthy?

279
00:14:09,700 --> 00:14:10,500
Filthy?

280
00:14:15,940 --> 00:14:16,660
Filthy?

281
00:14:21,500 --> 00:14:21,820
That's right.

282
00:14:23,980 --> 00:14:25,380
I'm just like this place now.

283
00:14:26,420 --> 00:14:27,540
A disgrace to everyone!

284
00:14:28,140 --> 00:14:28,620
Wenji.

285
00:14:29,500 --> 00:14:30,820
Chunhua's just worried about you.
She didn't...

286
00:14:33,460 --> 00:14:34,100
Back in Lingnan,

287
00:14:35,540 --> 00:14:37,380
every one of you called me a genius.

288
00:14:38,700 --> 00:14:40,060
You all said I was brilliant.

289
00:14:41,340 --> 00:14:42,020
You even said

290
00:14:43,020 --> 00:14:44,420
I deserved every word of praise.

291
00:14:47,460 --> 00:14:49,260
I studied so hard.

292
00:14:50,380 --> 00:14:51,180
And what did it get me?

293
00:14:54,020 --> 00:14:54,580
What did it get me?

294
00:14:56,300 --> 00:14:57,380
You've all risen to greatness,

295
00:14:57,940 --> 00:14:58,860
basking in glory.

296
00:15:00,220 --> 00:15:01,580
And I failed miserably,

297
00:15:02,860 --> 00:15:04,460
bringing shame upon my family.

298
00:15:09,780 --> 00:15:11,260
How could I possibly
be worthy of your company?

299
00:15:21,660 --> 00:15:22,060
Chunhua.

300
00:15:25,340 --> 00:15:26,620
You must be terribly disappointed in me.

301
00:15:32,500 --> 00:15:32,940
Look.

302
00:15:35,900 --> 00:15:37,460
I can see it in your eyes.

303
00:15:39,540 --> 00:15:40,740
Nothing but pity,

304
00:15:42,900 --> 00:15:44,060
disappointment,

305
00:15:46,580 --> 00:15:47,460
and confusion.

306
00:15:53,700 --> 00:15:54,180
Oh, I forgot.

307
00:15:56,500 --> 00:15:58,540
One of you is a third-place scholar.

308
00:15:59,540 --> 00:16:00,140
The other

309
00:16:00,740 --> 00:16:02,020
is merely a servant,

310
00:16:02,860 --> 00:16:04,980
but has the princess's favor.

311
00:16:05,980 --> 00:16:07,580
No wonder you both look down on me.

312
00:16:14,100 --> 00:16:15,820
What do you mean, "merely a servant"?

313
00:16:18,140 --> 00:16:18,780
Liu Wenji.

314
00:16:20,180 --> 00:16:21,860
Is that really how you see me?

315
00:16:23,860 --> 00:16:24,300
Chunhua.

316
00:16:25,060 --> 00:16:26,140
He's had a terrible day.

317
00:16:26,660 --> 00:16:27,340
He's drunk.

318
00:16:27,940 --> 00:16:28,300
Wenji.

319
00:16:28,500 --> 00:16:29,780
Spare me your empty sympathy.

320
00:16:31,020 --> 00:16:32,100
You came rushing over

321
00:16:32,580 --> 00:16:33,740
just to laugh at me, didn't you?

322
00:16:34,940 --> 00:16:35,380
Yan Shang.

323
00:16:36,260 --> 00:16:37,660
What gives you the right to mock me?

324
00:16:39,340 --> 00:16:40,900
You always act so high and mighty,

325
00:16:41,340 --> 00:16:43,500
yet you'd even stoop to becoming
the princess's male favorite

326
00:16:43,500 --> 00:16:44,260
just to gain her favor.

327
00:16:45,140 --> 00:16:47,700
I, Liu Wenji, would never associate
with the likes of you.

328
00:16:47,700 --> 00:16:48,220
And you.

329
00:16:51,180 --> 00:16:52,740
If you'd been willing to help me

330
00:16:52,980 --> 00:16:55,260
and put in a good word for me
with the princess,

331
00:16:55,820 --> 00:16:57,700
why should I alone have no one
to recommend me?

332
00:16:57,900 --> 00:16:59,420
Why would I be the only one who failed?

333
00:17:23,980 --> 00:17:24,460
Wenji.

334
00:17:30,460 --> 00:17:31,300
Once you're sober,

335
00:17:32,420 --> 00:17:33,260
I'll come find you again.

336
00:17:34,220 --> 00:17:35,220
I only hope that by then,

337
00:17:38,220 --> 00:17:39,380
Chunhua will still be willing
to see you.

338
00:18:05,300 --> 00:18:06,460
There, there.

339
00:18:06,740 --> 00:18:08,060
Look at you, poor thing.

340
00:18:08,860 --> 00:18:10,020
Even back in North Jing,

341
00:18:10,580 --> 00:18:11,900
I never saw you cry this much.

342
00:18:13,020 --> 00:18:14,140
You didn't see

343
00:18:15,060 --> 00:18:16,460
the way he behaved.

344
00:18:17,020 --> 00:18:18,020
Good thing I didn't!

345
00:18:19,300 --> 00:18:21,220
Otherwise, I'd have beaten him
half to death!

346
00:18:22,020 --> 00:18:23,780
You and Yan Shang shouldn't
have gone looking for him.

347
00:18:24,500 --> 00:18:25,340
Let him drink himself to death

348
00:18:25,940 --> 00:18:27,100
and rot in that brothel!

349
00:18:27,260 --> 00:18:27,900
It's not like that.

350
00:18:29,700 --> 00:18:31,220
He was just so upset.

351
00:18:32,940 --> 00:18:34,780
That's why he said such awful things.

352
00:18:35,500 --> 00:18:36,220
And you're not upset?

353
00:18:36,660 --> 00:18:37,580
Yet you're still defending him.

354
00:18:39,300 --> 00:18:41,740
Countless scholars
fail the imperial exams.

355
00:18:42,020 --> 00:18:43,460
But I've rarely seen anyone
behave like him,

356
00:18:44,580 --> 00:18:46,540
lashing out at his friend
and the woman he loves!

357
00:18:47,500 --> 00:18:48,140
The way I see it,

358
00:18:48,780 --> 00:18:50,140
he's been a spoiled young master
for too long.

359
00:18:50,540 --> 00:18:51,420
Deep down,

360
00:18:51,620 --> 00:18:53,300
he's never seen Yan Shang or you

361
00:18:53,620 --> 00:18:55,100
as his equals.

362
00:18:56,220 --> 00:18:57,020
Now that he's failed,

363
00:18:57,500 --> 00:18:58,660
his pride has given way to insecurity,

364
00:18:58,980 --> 00:18:59,860
and he's taking it out on everyone.

365
00:19:07,180 --> 00:19:08,660
There, there. It's all right.

366
00:19:11,340 --> 00:19:12,100
There, now.

367
00:19:12,940 --> 00:19:14,460
Stop crying. It's all right.

368
00:19:15,700 --> 00:19:17,340
Get some proper rest here today.

369
00:19:17,740 --> 00:19:18,540
Have something to eat.

370
00:19:19,540 --> 00:19:20,700
We'll worry about tomorrow
when it comes.

371
00:19:27,380 --> 00:19:28,260
(Imperial Academy)
Excellent!

372
00:19:29,060 --> 00:19:30,340
Wonderful! Wonderful!

373
00:19:31,660 --> 00:19:33,420
You've taken first place
in the imperial exams.

374
00:19:33,660 --> 00:19:34,940
You have a brilliant future
ahead of you.

375
00:19:35,620 --> 00:19:36,420
Shu,

376
00:19:37,060 --> 00:19:38,100
I know

377
00:19:38,700 --> 00:19:41,900
you're not the sort to repay kindness
with ingratitude.

378
00:19:42,540 --> 00:19:43,700
Your success today

379
00:19:44,020 --> 00:19:44,780
owes a great deal

380
00:19:45,140 --> 00:19:48,420
to all the guidance and support
I've given you over the years.

381
00:19:56,420 --> 00:19:57,740
I'm talking to you!

382
00:20:00,980 --> 00:20:01,380
Master.

383
00:20:02,540 --> 00:20:03,860
What's on your mind?

384
00:20:05,420 --> 00:20:05,860
Master.

385
00:20:07,660 --> 00:20:08,580
I have an appointment

386
00:20:09,540 --> 00:20:10,700
with Princess Danyang tonight.

387
00:20:11,780 --> 00:20:12,460
If I don't leave now,

388
00:20:12,980 --> 00:20:13,820
I'm afraid I'll be late.

389
00:20:14,660 --> 00:20:15,180
Of course!

390
00:20:15,940 --> 00:20:16,300
Go!

391
00:20:16,980 --> 00:20:17,380
Hurry along!

392
00:20:18,860 --> 00:20:19,220
Then,

393
00:20:20,260 --> 00:20:21,260
I'll take my leave.

394
00:20:21,660 --> 00:20:21,980
Go on!

395
00:20:25,020 --> 00:20:25,980
I knew it.

396
00:20:26,740 --> 00:20:28,420
You won't let me down.

397
00:20:30,860 --> 00:20:32,300
The daughter of Yaoguang Star

398
00:20:33,380 --> 00:20:34,860
can bring glory to the royal house.

399
00:20:37,780 --> 00:20:39,140
A daughter of my Li family

400
00:20:40,260 --> 00:20:41,900
must not be given away to an outsider!

401
00:20:47,100 --> 00:20:48,420
Tonight's banquet

402
00:20:48,540 --> 00:20:50,020
is to celebrate both of your successes.

403
00:20:55,020 --> 00:20:56,180
Stop looking so miserable!

404
00:20:56,820 --> 00:20:57,660
Cheer up!

405
00:21:01,260 --> 00:21:02,340
That looks so fake!

406
00:21:02,940 --> 00:21:04,020
Don't smile, then.

407
00:21:08,180 --> 00:21:08,660
Wei Shu,

408
00:21:09,500 --> 00:21:10,940
you came first in the entire
imperial exam.

409
00:21:11,380 --> 00:21:12,500
Why do you look so sad?

410
00:21:13,780 --> 00:21:14,260
Yan Shang,

411
00:21:15,420 --> 00:21:17,420
remember the night before the exams?

412
00:21:18,660 --> 00:21:20,100
The four of us drank tea under the moon

413
00:21:20,540 --> 00:21:21,740
and vowed to be lifelong friends.

414
00:21:23,140 --> 00:21:24,100
Yet in the blink of an eye,

415
00:21:25,260 --> 00:21:26,380
only the two of us remain.

416
00:21:27,420 --> 00:21:28,500
Life is unpredictable,

417
00:21:29,180 --> 00:21:30,020
and our paths often diverge.

418
00:21:31,020 --> 00:21:33,060
We're fortunate enough
to have shared part of the journey.

419
00:21:33,660 --> 00:21:35,340
We can't force the rest.

420
00:21:40,420 --> 00:21:41,420
Then let's raise a cup

421
00:21:41,900 --> 00:21:42,700
to you two fellow travelers.

422
00:21:56,820 --> 00:21:59,100
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

423
00:22:00,500 --> 00:22:04,450
♪The midsummer breeze blows soft;
Fireflies dance through the night♪

424
00:22:04,450 --> 00:22:08,940
♪The midsummer breeze blows soft;
Fireflies dance through the night♪

425
00:22:11,980 --> 00:22:12,580
Wei Shu.

426
00:22:14,100 --> 00:22:14,580
Wei Shu.

427
00:22:17,020 --> 00:22:19,100
You'll catch a chill
if you sleep out here.

428
00:22:20,900 --> 00:22:21,300
Wei Shu.

429
00:22:26,140 --> 00:22:30,940
♪Life is but a fleeting stay; How lucky
I am to walk this path with you♪

430
00:22:30,940 --> 00:22:31,420
Your Highness,

431
00:22:32,900 --> 00:22:33,900
I'm feeling a little sleepy.

432
00:22:36,020 --> 00:22:37,060
It's getting late.

433
00:22:37,580 --> 00:22:38,340
Tonight,

434
00:22:38,820 --> 00:22:40,340
you can stay here at my residence.

435
00:22:43,260 --> 00:22:50,060
♪I thought time might stand still;
Forever at that crossroads♪

436
00:22:50,060 --> 00:22:50,940
Thank you, Your Highness.

437
00:22:52,140 --> 00:22:52,740
Careful, Your Highness.

438
00:22:52,740 --> 00:22:58,140
♪Watching flowers bloom and fade;
Weathering life's rise and fall♪

439
00:22:58,140 --> 00:22:58,500
Your Highness,

440
00:22:59,460 --> 00:23:00,980
thank you for securing my rightful place
in the exam results.

441
00:23:01,300 --> 00:23:02,620
There's no need to thank me.

442
00:23:03,180 --> 00:23:06,260
You earned it back
through your own efforts.

443
00:23:07,060 --> 00:23:08,020
Then thank you

444
00:23:08,700 --> 00:23:09,380
for coming to tell me that day.

445
00:23:13,580 --> 00:23:13,900
Your Highness.

446
00:23:19,380 --> 00:23:20,620
Your Highness, you're drunk too.

447
00:23:21,260 --> 00:23:22,340
Let me take you back to your room.

448
00:23:23,460 --> 00:23:25,060
It's not often we have something
to celebrate.

449
00:23:25,420 --> 00:23:26,500
When there's cause for celebration,

450
00:23:26,980 --> 00:23:28,540
we ought to have a few more drinks.

451
00:23:29,140 --> 00:23:31,060
Life is but a hundred years.

452
00:23:31,780 --> 00:23:33,260
How often do we get

453
00:23:33,700 --> 00:23:35,180
the chance to drink
to our hearts' content

454
00:23:35,940 --> 00:23:37,060
and celebrate something truly wonderful?

455
00:23:44,540 --> 00:23:46,060
Yan Shang,

456
00:23:47,420 --> 00:23:48,500
tell me,

457
00:23:49,460 --> 00:23:51,620
are you just ridiculously lucky,

458
00:23:52,460 --> 00:23:54,500
or did you stumble into success
without even trying?

459
00:23:55,380 --> 00:23:56,300
You came to Sheng'an

460
00:23:56,660 --> 00:23:57,820
because of Zhang Renjing.

461
00:23:58,260 --> 00:24:00,580
Yet you got that third-place title
handed to you...

462
00:24:01,980 --> 00:24:04,620
If those scholars who failed

463
00:24:05,340 --> 00:24:06,060
ever found out,

464
00:24:07,060 --> 00:24:09,420
they'd eat you alive!

465
00:24:11,780 --> 00:24:12,860
Then I'll have to ask Your Highness

466
00:24:13,460 --> 00:24:14,300
to keep my secret.

467
00:24:16,540 --> 00:24:17,940
I could keep your secret.

468
00:24:19,820 --> 00:24:20,500
But you...

469
00:24:22,540 --> 00:24:23,340
So,

470
00:24:24,140 --> 00:24:25,340
how will you thank me?

471
00:24:31,220 --> 00:24:32,260
Whatever Your Highness wishes.

472
00:24:34,340 --> 00:24:36,860
Then I'll have to give it some thought.

473
00:24:38,300 --> 00:24:43,180
♪Be the ferry where you wait
for the sun♪

474
00:24:43,940 --> 00:24:45,060
Why are you pulling away?

475
00:24:45,740 --> 00:24:48,620
Can you really not stand
even a hint of wine?

476
00:24:52,820 --> 00:24:58,900
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

477
00:25:01,420 --> 00:25:01,940
Yes.

478
00:25:03,500 --> 00:25:04,540
Your Highness is too close.

479
00:25:05,940 --> 00:25:06,340
I'm...

480
00:25:08,100 --> 00:25:09,060
about to lose my senses.

481
00:25:12,540 --> 00:25:19,220
♪- Through trails of mud and blood
- Let grief drown in your eyes♪

482
00:25:22,180 --> 00:25:23,300
I don't believe you.

483
00:25:24,540 --> 00:25:27,460
Everything you say is a lie.

484
00:25:29,060 --> 00:25:30,740
You tricked Zhang Renjing to his death

485
00:25:31,780 --> 00:25:33,620
and made Feng Xianyu suffer
with your lies.

486
00:25:34,540 --> 00:25:39,220
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

487
00:25:39,620 --> 00:25:40,660
I would never lie to you.

488
00:25:41,300 --> 00:25:45,040
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

489
00:25:45,040 --> 00:25:48,940
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

490
00:25:48,980 --> 00:25:52,420
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

491
00:25:52,540 --> 00:25:56,100
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

492
00:25:56,180 --> 00:26:03,100
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

493
00:26:03,340 --> 00:26:05,220
♪- May time be free of fear
- Boats rock♪

494
00:26:05,220 --> 00:26:07,860
♪- Lights fade, seasons turn
- May time be free of pain♪

495
00:26:07,900 --> 00:26:09,420
♪You're the only one I need♪

496
00:26:09,420 --> 00:26:10,060
What?

497
00:26:10,820 --> 00:26:11,820
You're willing to drink now?

498
00:26:13,660 --> 00:26:14,060
Your Highness,

499
00:26:15,740 --> 00:26:16,580
I can't hold my liquor.

500
00:26:17,660 --> 00:26:18,420
Even a drop makes me drunk.

501
00:26:20,140 --> 00:26:24,300
But tonight...

502
00:26:24,300 --> 00:26:25,140
I'd like to have a taste.

503
00:26:32,100 --> 00:26:35,460
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

504
00:26:35,620 --> 00:26:39,100
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

505
00:26:39,260 --> 00:26:46,180
♪If we're lucky to stay in this world,
let's return to when we first met♪

506
00:26:46,380 --> 00:26:48,260
♪- May time be free of fear
- Boats rock♪

507
00:26:48,260 --> 00:26:50,900
♪- Lights fade, seasons turn
- May time be free of pain♪

508
00:26:50,940 --> 00:26:53,500
♪You're the only one I need♪

509
00:26:57,500 --> 00:26:58,100
Yan Shang?

510
00:26:59,620 --> 00:27:00,220
Yan Shang!

511
00:27:04,700 --> 00:27:06,820
You really can't handle a single drop.

512
00:27:09,620 --> 00:27:10,300
Yan Shang!

513
00:27:30,180 --> 00:27:31,300
With a tolerance like yours,

514
00:27:32,100 --> 00:27:33,140
if an enemy came after you,

515
00:27:34,060 --> 00:27:35,260
they wouldn't even need poison.

516
00:27:36,060 --> 00:27:37,700
A few drops of wine would do the trick!

517
00:27:38,340 --> 00:27:39,420
You can't even handle wine,

518
00:27:39,700 --> 00:27:40,660
yet you're so heavy!

519
00:27:53,740 --> 00:27:54,860
You look like skin and bones,

520
00:27:55,340 --> 00:27:56,140
but you weigh a ton!

521
00:27:56,980 --> 00:27:58,220
You're a real crafty schemer!

522
00:28:00,620 --> 00:28:02,140
You're always so quiet,

523
00:28:03,580 --> 00:28:04,460
putting up with everything.

524
00:28:05,380 --> 00:28:06,220
But when you're up to no good,

525
00:28:07,100 --> 00:28:08,340
you're full of wicked schemes.

526
00:28:14,980 --> 00:28:15,660
Your Highness...

527
00:28:18,980 --> 00:28:19,660
Wanyao.

528
00:28:21,980 --> 00:28:22,580
What?

529
00:28:24,180 --> 00:28:24,940
Wanyao.

530
00:28:44,420 --> 00:28:45,900
Don't be afraid, Wanyao.

531
00:28:48,980 --> 00:28:50,340
Don't leave me, Wanyao.

532
00:28:53,260 --> 00:28:58,620
♪Let me hold you
whenever the rain falls♪

533
00:28:58,740 --> 00:29:03,300
♪- Together we'll soar to the skies
- Together we'll turn to ashes♪

534
00:29:03,300 --> 00:29:05,020
♪Burning bright as a song♪

535
00:29:05,020 --> 00:29:08,620
♪Two shadows entwined,
a beautiful sight♪

536
00:29:08,780 --> 00:29:13,700
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

537
00:29:13,740 --> 00:29:18,540
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

538
00:29:18,580 --> 00:29:20,420
♪Not a single hour less♪

539
00:29:24,980 --> 00:29:25,500
Yan Shang.

540
00:29:27,620 --> 00:29:28,660
Dream a little longer.

541
00:29:30,060 --> 00:29:30,860
When you wake up,

542
00:29:32,540 --> 00:29:33,820
I won't be able to give you anything.

543
00:29:35,460 --> 00:29:42,340
♪If we're lucky to stay in this world,
let's return to when we first met♪

544
00:29:42,580 --> 00:29:44,940
♪- May time be free of fear
- Boats rock♪

545
00:29:44,940 --> 00:29:47,100
♪- Lights fade, seasons turn
- May time be free of pain♪

546
00:29:47,140 --> 00:29:49,700
♪You're the only one I need♪

547
00:29:49,740 --> 00:29:53,420
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

548
00:29:53,420 --> 00:29:56,900
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

549
00:29:56,940 --> 00:30:00,340
♪- Be my one and only in this world
- Be my one and only in this life♪

550
00:30:00,380 --> 00:30:03,820
♪My last untouched innocence♪

551
00:30:42,500 --> 00:30:45,060
So you've finally decided
to treat your uncle well today.

552
00:30:58,460 --> 00:30:59,460
Uncle, what brings you here

553
00:31:00,060 --> 00:31:00,780
to lecture me today?

554
00:31:01,380 --> 00:31:03,740
Marriage is the most important event
in a woman's life.

555
00:31:04,500 --> 00:31:05,740
How can I rest easy

556
00:31:06,340 --> 00:31:07,740
until you're properly married?

557
00:31:08,980 --> 00:31:09,460
Uncle,

558
00:31:10,380 --> 00:31:11,540
wasn't my marriage

559
00:31:11,940 --> 00:31:13,860
already celebrated with a grand wedding?

560
00:31:15,180 --> 00:31:16,820
Since you're so fond of matchmaking
for princesses,

561
00:31:17,540 --> 00:31:20,140
why not visit my aunt

562
00:31:20,420 --> 00:31:21,380
and see what she thinks?

563
00:31:22,140 --> 00:31:24,100
Perhaps she's eager to marry.

564
00:31:24,700 --> 00:31:25,340
Wanyao.

565
00:31:26,940 --> 00:31:27,980
I'm being serious.

566
00:31:28,860 --> 00:31:31,140
It's not as though I've tried
to marry you off

567
00:31:31,420 --> 00:31:33,620
to some old, ugly, pockmarked,
blind fool.

568
00:31:34,940 --> 00:31:36,340
I've been worrying myself sick

569
00:31:36,460 --> 00:31:37,940
trying to secure your happiness.

570
00:31:38,940 --> 00:31:39,780
I chose Wei Shu,

571
00:31:40,180 --> 00:31:42,580
a scholar blessed
with extraordinary talent.

572
00:31:43,340 --> 00:31:45,420
And now he's actually taken first place
in the imperial exams.

573
00:31:46,180 --> 00:31:48,700
Tell me, in what way
is he unworthy of you?

574
00:31:49,220 --> 00:31:50,100
Surely he's far better

575
00:31:50,100 --> 00:31:52,140
than that short-lived old geezer
you married before.

576
00:31:52,660 --> 00:31:53,540
You're quite right.

577
00:31:55,460 --> 00:31:57,020
My first marriage was for Father's sake.

578
00:31:57,700 --> 00:31:58,540
It seems my second

579
00:31:59,140 --> 00:31:59,940
will be for yours, Uncle.

580
00:32:01,860 --> 00:32:03,820
How is this for my sake?

581
00:32:04,700 --> 00:32:05,380
Wanyao,

582
00:32:05,940 --> 00:32:07,780
marriage, you see,

583
00:32:08,180 --> 00:32:11,260
is about uniting two families
for mutual benefit.

584
00:32:11,700 --> 00:32:13,980
It's been that way for ages.
What's wrong with that?

585
00:32:16,700 --> 00:32:19,340
I'd have liked to marry you
to my eldest son.

586
00:32:20,300 --> 00:32:23,660
But marrying within the bloodline
brings terrible misfortune.

587
00:32:25,380 --> 00:32:28,380
Now that Shu has topped
the imperial exams,

588
00:32:29,420 --> 00:32:30,460
if he marries a princess,

589
00:32:30,820 --> 00:32:32,220
wouldn't that be perfect for everyone?

590
00:32:32,700 --> 00:32:33,460
Enough, Uncle.

591
00:32:34,100 --> 00:32:35,540
You've said all this countless times.

592
00:32:36,580 --> 00:32:37,260
I understand.

593
00:32:39,180 --> 00:32:40,140
I have other matters to attend to today.

594
00:32:40,360 --> 00:32:40,860
Hey...

595
00:32:43,660 --> 00:32:44,780
That attitude of yours...

596
00:32:45,780 --> 00:32:47,780
You're exactly like your mother!

597
00:32:50,300 --> 00:32:51,620
What do you mean by that, Uncle?

598
00:32:52,940 --> 00:32:55,620
Your mother was just as determined
not to marry!

599
00:32:56,220 --> 00:32:58,060
I had to appeal to her sense of duty.

600
00:32:58,340 --> 00:33:00,140
I don't know how many times
I had to persuade her!

601
00:33:00,700 --> 00:33:01,460
My mother...

602
00:33:02,180 --> 00:33:02,860
She didn't want to marry?

603
00:33:05,580 --> 00:33:06,860
She was so determined
not to enter the palace

604
00:33:07,340 --> 00:33:09,100
that she nearly lost her life.

605
00:33:09,940 --> 00:33:10,500
And what happened?

606
00:33:11,100 --> 00:33:13,540
Your father ascended
the throne soon afterward,

607
00:33:13,900 --> 00:33:16,420
and the Li family rose
to unprecedented glory!

608
00:33:18,300 --> 00:33:19,820
Back then,

609
00:33:20,780 --> 00:33:22,740
if I, as her elder brother,

610
00:33:23,220 --> 00:33:24,100
hadn't beaten and scolded her

611
00:33:24,460 --> 00:33:25,540
and forced her into that bridal sedan,

612
00:33:25,860 --> 00:33:26,980
how could she have enjoyed

613
00:33:26,980 --> 00:33:29,660
a lifetime of glory as Empress of Huai?

614
00:33:30,700 --> 00:33:32,020
So, Wanyao,

615
00:33:32,700 --> 00:33:34,540
don't blame me for pushing you.

616
00:33:35,100 --> 00:33:36,580
Your mother is gone now.

617
00:33:37,220 --> 00:33:38,100
I'm your elder,

618
00:33:38,660 --> 00:33:39,780
and more importantly, your family.

619
00:33:41,060 --> 00:33:41,340
Would I...

620
00:33:41,940 --> 00:33:43,660
Would I ever do anything to hurt you?

621
00:34:02,460 --> 00:34:05,380
(Zhegui Garden)

622
00:34:09,140 --> 00:34:10,380
Every year, after the exam results
are announced,

623
00:34:10,980 --> 00:34:13,060
the successful scholars inscribe
their names at the Wild Goose Pagoda

624
00:34:13,700 --> 00:34:14,580
before attending a banquet here.

625
00:34:15,700 --> 00:34:17,220
You two should mingle

626
00:34:18,180 --> 00:34:19,380
and get to know your fellow graduates.

627
00:34:22,100 --> 00:34:23,020
There are too many people here.

628
00:34:23,340 --> 00:34:24,420
I will stay with you, Your Highness.

629
00:34:25,700 --> 00:34:26,380
Indeed.

630
00:34:27,180 --> 00:34:28,460
Nearly every family of officials

631
00:34:29,340 --> 00:34:30,500
in the capital must be here today.

632
00:34:31,300 --> 00:34:31,620
(Zhegui Garden)
Let's go.

633
00:34:39,460 --> 00:34:41,140
(Zhao Lingfei; General of the Guard's
Daughter, Yang Si's Cousin)

634
00:34:41,140 --> 00:34:41,740
Yang Si.

635
00:34:42,420 --> 00:34:43,540
Where are all the new scholars?

636
00:34:43,860 --> 00:34:44,820
Just follow me inside.

637
00:34:45,740 --> 00:34:46,820
But put that whip away first.

638
00:34:46,940 --> 00:34:48,380
You'll scare them all off
if you bring it in.

639
00:34:49,580 --> 00:34:50,300
If you ask me,

640
00:34:50,820 --> 00:34:51,940
you're wasting your time here.

641
00:34:52,620 --> 00:34:54,220
Those scholars are nothing
but bookworms.

642
00:34:54,940 --> 00:34:56,020
I guarantee you won't like a single one.

643
00:34:57,380 --> 00:34:57,700
Oh, right.

644
00:34:58,220 --> 00:34:59,340
Your father told me to keep an eye
on you today.

645
00:34:59,700 --> 00:35:00,300
Don't cause me any trouble.

646
00:35:01,740 --> 00:35:03,060
I'd rather choose my own husband

647
00:35:03,300 --> 00:35:04,540
than let my father choose for me.

648
00:35:05,180 --> 00:35:07,500
True heroes are hard to find these days.

649
00:35:07,780 --> 00:35:08,540
If any of these scholars

650
00:35:08,860 --> 00:35:10,260
happens to be exceptionally handsome,

651
00:35:10,620 --> 00:35:11,580
even if he's not much of a fighter,

652
00:35:11,780 --> 00:35:12,380
I could settle for him.

653
00:35:12,860 --> 00:35:14,780
They're the finest scholars
in the country.

654
00:35:15,140 --> 00:35:15,900
And you'd be settling for them?

655
00:35:26,460 --> 00:35:26,860
Wanyao.

656
00:35:31,660 --> 00:35:32,780
What are you two doing here?

657
00:35:37,420 --> 00:35:39,540
You must be this year's Top Scholar.

658
00:35:44,060 --> 00:35:45,260
They're both
top-ranked presented scholars.

659
00:35:45,700 --> 00:35:46,820
They have every reason to be here.

660
00:35:47,340 --> 00:35:49,940
What are you doing here
when you don't even study?

661
00:35:52,220 --> 00:35:54,060
I heard they always choose someone
handsome for third place.

662
00:35:54,500 --> 00:35:55,660
But you're both so good-looking.

663
00:35:55,980 --> 00:35:56,780
Which one came third?

664
00:36:03,900 --> 00:36:05,700
Yang Si, aren't you going to
introduce us?

665
00:36:05,820 --> 00:36:08,060
(Shouwen Pavilion)

666
00:36:08,060 --> 00:36:09,260
This is my younger cousin
on my mother's side,

667
00:36:09,500 --> 00:36:10,300
General Zhao's only daughter.

668
00:36:10,580 --> 00:36:11,140
Her name is Lingfei.

669
00:36:11,540 --> 00:36:13,100
Lingfei, pay your respects
to Princess Danyang!

670
00:36:14,780 --> 00:36:15,420
Greetings, Your Highness.

671
00:36:15,580 --> 00:36:16,460
So you're the one who...

672
00:36:19,180 --> 00:36:19,620
The one...

673
00:36:22,060 --> 00:36:22,500
The one who what?

674
00:36:23,580 --> 00:36:24,340
Nothing, Your Highness.

675
00:36:25,180 --> 00:36:26,740
Who are those two handsome gentlemen

676
00:36:26,740 --> 00:36:27,500
standing behind you?

677
00:36:30,220 --> 00:36:31,100
Why don't you ask them yourself?

678
00:36:31,580 --> 00:36:32,220
Why ask me?

679
00:36:33,020 --> 00:36:34,580
All right! What are your names?

680
00:36:36,340 --> 00:36:37,540
Hey! Why are you dragging me away?

681
00:36:37,660 --> 00:36:38,700
Neither of those two is any good.

682
00:36:38,820 --> 00:36:39,180
(Shouwen Pavilion)
Let's go.

683
00:36:47,980 --> 00:36:50,580
(Top Scholar Honors)

684
00:36:50,580 --> 00:36:51,940
(Top Scholar: Wei Shu)

685
00:36:51,940 --> 00:36:53,420
(Second Place: Li Wenqing;
Third Place: Yan Shang)

686
00:36:53,420 --> 00:36:55,340
(Presented Scholar:
Lin Mengran, Zhang Ruiqiu, Yu Pingjun)

687
00:36:55,340 --> 00:36:57,060
(Top Scholar Honors)

688
00:36:58,660 --> 00:37:00,860
(Top Scholar Honors)

689
00:37:05,140 --> 00:37:07,140
(Top Scholar Honors)

690
00:37:12,580 --> 00:37:15,180
(Bravo! Bravo!)

691
00:37:18,700 --> 00:37:19,860
(Top Scholar Honors)

692
00:37:22,500 --> 00:37:22,900
Here you go!

693
00:37:22,980 --> 00:37:24,340
(Top Scholar Honors)

694
00:37:27,460 --> 00:37:27,700
(Top Scholar Honors)
(What...)

695
00:37:27,700 --> 00:37:28,100
(Top Scholar Honors)
What's wrong?

696
00:37:29,100 --> 00:37:29,420
Oh...

697
00:37:32,100 --> 00:37:33,580
I'm so sorry! Let me see!

698
00:37:35,500 --> 00:37:36,180
Your face!

699
00:37:38,740 --> 00:37:39,860
His Majesty will be here any moment!

700
00:37:40,020 --> 00:37:41,940
You can't have an injured face
right now!

701
00:37:42,620 --> 00:37:43,860
What are we going to do?

702
00:37:44,900 --> 00:37:45,340
Come on! Let's go!

703
00:37:57,780 --> 00:37:58,420
Top Scholar.

704
00:37:58,940 --> 00:37:59,780
Feeling any better?

705
00:38:00,820 --> 00:38:02,300
We were playing a drinking game,

706
00:38:02,580 --> 00:38:04,140
and accidentally hurt you.

707
00:38:10,580 --> 00:38:12,060
I hope I didn't cause
any internal injuries.

708
00:38:12,580 --> 00:38:13,540
Why is your face so red?

709
00:38:15,260 --> 00:38:16,700
No, I'm fine.

710
00:38:17,620 --> 00:38:18,500
Please don't worry about me, Miss.

711
00:38:18,940 --> 00:38:19,820
How could I not?

712
00:38:19,980 --> 00:38:20,820
You're the Top Scholar!

713
00:38:21,140 --> 00:38:22,820
If anything happens to you,
I'll never hear the end of it.

714
00:38:27,460 --> 00:38:28,820
(Look how spoiled and arrogant she is!)

715
00:38:29,340 --> 00:38:30,340
(Does she look like a fallen woman?)

716
00:38:31,020 --> 00:38:32,340
(Whether she looks it or not,
she is one.)

717
00:38:32,500 --> 00:38:33,420
Appearing in public is nothing!

718
00:38:33,660 --> 00:38:34,100
I heard

719
00:38:34,620 --> 00:38:35,660
that when she was in North Jing...

720
00:38:36,660 --> 00:38:37,260
(I heard)

721
00:38:37,820 --> 00:38:39,060
(this year's top scholar)

722
00:38:39,580 --> 00:38:41,060
(is one of her male favorites!)

723
00:38:42,020 --> 00:38:42,740
(Really? Is that true?)

724
00:38:43,620 --> 00:38:44,420
(You haven't heard?)

725
00:38:44,860 --> 00:38:46,060
(The third-place scholar)

726
00:38:46,420 --> 00:38:48,140
(is always coming and going
from her residence.)

727
00:38:50,180 --> 00:38:52,340
(Who knew she was
such a promiscuous widow?)

728
00:38:54,060 --> 00:38:54,700
Are you angry?

729
00:38:54,940 --> 00:38:55,700
Are you going to fight them?

730
00:38:55,700 --> 00:38:56,420
(You even know about that?)

731
00:38:56,420 --> 00:38:56,900
Want me to do it?

732
00:38:56,900 --> 00:38:57,420
(I had no idea!)

733
00:38:57,860 --> 00:38:58,940
(Look at her! Who's she trying to fool?)

734
00:39:00,020 --> 00:39:01,020
(Who would've thought?)

735
00:39:01,020 --> 00:39:01,500
I can't beat them.

736
00:39:01,660 --> 00:39:02,580
(Come on, let's drink!)

737
00:39:05,740 --> 00:39:07,500
You're quite handsome yourself.

738
00:39:07,980 --> 00:39:09,700
Why don't you become
one of their male favorites?

739
00:39:09,700 --> 00:39:10,340
What do you say?

740
00:39:10,780 --> 00:39:11,860
(I wish I could!)

741
00:39:12,060 --> 00:39:13,340
(But she wouldn't give me
a second look!)

742
00:39:13,820 --> 00:39:15,820
(You've got a point!)

743
00:39:17,100 --> 00:39:18,100
(She may be promiscuous,)

744
00:39:18,460 --> 00:39:19,660
(but she's certainly beautiful...)

745
00:39:19,980 --> 00:39:21,020
(Fire! There's a fire over here!)

746
00:39:22,420 --> 00:39:23,020
(Mr. Zhen! You're on fire!)

747
00:39:23,180 --> 00:39:23,700
(Move! Get out of the way!)

748
00:39:23,940 --> 00:39:24,380
(Are you all right?)

749
00:39:24,580 --> 00:39:25,500
Where did that strange fire come from?

750
00:39:26,060 --> 00:39:26,900
How did it suddenly catch fire?

751
00:39:26,900 --> 00:39:27,460
Is your backside all right?

752
00:39:29,260 --> 00:39:30,180
You know magic?

753
00:39:30,660 --> 00:39:31,300
It's not magic.

754
00:39:32,060 --> 00:39:33,380
I promise I won't tell anyone.

755
00:39:34,540 --> 00:39:35,420
It's no secret.

756
00:39:35,820 --> 00:39:36,820
Then can I ask you something?

757
00:39:37,420 --> 00:39:38,380
What they said isn't true.

758
00:39:42,100 --> 00:39:43,100
Her Highness is a good person.

759
00:39:43,540 --> 00:39:44,500
She doesn't deserve to be spoken
of that way.

760
00:39:47,060 --> 00:39:49,100
I thought you were angry because

761
00:39:49,100 --> 00:39:50,260
they were gossiping about you.

762
00:39:51,780 --> 00:39:53,060
Then can I ask you another question?

763
00:39:54,180 --> 00:39:54,580
What is it?

764
00:39:55,540 --> 00:39:56,660
That magic trick you just did...

765
00:39:56,740 --> 00:39:57,580
Could you teach me?

766
00:39:58,460 --> 00:40:00,180
I promise I won't use it
for anything bad!

767
00:40:03,140 --> 00:40:03,820
It's not magic.

768
00:40:04,380 --> 00:40:04,860
It's this.

769
00:40:06,700 --> 00:40:07,940
What kind of magical treasure is that?

770
00:40:09,260 --> 00:40:10,180
I'm not sure.

771
00:40:11,140 --> 00:40:12,100
How can you not know?

772
00:40:12,300 --> 00:40:13,260
Did you just pick it up somewhere?

773
00:40:13,620 --> 00:40:14,500
I made it myself.

774
00:40:15,180 --> 00:40:16,820
I just haven't thought of a name for it.

775
00:40:17,540 --> 00:40:18,340
That's amazing!

776
00:40:20,060 --> 00:40:20,780
It's just an unconventional
little trick.

777
00:40:21,300 --> 00:40:21,820
Nothing impressive.

778
00:40:22,860 --> 00:40:23,660
Are you kidding?

779
00:40:24,060 --> 00:40:25,980
There have been countless top scholars
throughout history.

780
00:40:26,420 --> 00:40:27,060
But how many of them

781
00:40:27,060 --> 00:40:28,620
could make a little stone
that works magic?

782
00:40:29,340 --> 00:40:31,500
What's so hard about reading books
and writing essays?

783
00:40:32,020 --> 00:40:33,780
If I had enough money and free time,

784
00:40:34,340 --> 00:40:35,700
I could even teach my dog to read.

785
00:40:40,260 --> 00:40:41,300
(Hurry! The banquet's starting!)

786
00:40:41,420 --> 00:40:41,940
(His Majesty has arrived!)

787
00:41:01,500 --> 00:41:04,100
I personally selected you three
as the top-three scholars.

788
00:41:04,820 --> 00:41:05,300
Well?

789
00:41:06,140 --> 00:41:07,780
Has the success gone to your heads?

790
00:41:09,620 --> 00:41:10,300
You may all rise.

791
00:41:12,180 --> 00:41:13,060
Thank you, Your Majesty.

792
00:41:21,660 --> 00:41:24,020
The Top Scholar looks so composed,

793
00:41:24,740 --> 00:41:26,940
yet he's still a reckless young man.

794
00:41:27,500 --> 00:41:28,460
It's only been a few days.

795
00:41:28,820 --> 00:41:29,940
What happened to your face?

796
00:41:32,540 --> 00:41:33,420
Forgive my improper appearance,
Your Majesty.

797
00:41:33,980 --> 00:41:34,900
I deserve Your Majesty's punishment.

798
00:41:37,620 --> 00:41:38,220
Father,

799
00:41:38,580 --> 00:41:40,180
who would dare injure his face?

800
00:41:41,140 --> 00:41:41,860
If you ask me,

801
00:41:42,220 --> 00:41:45,060
it only makes Wei Shu
more charmingly youthful.

802
00:41:47,820 --> 00:41:48,180
Yes.

803
00:41:48,660 --> 00:41:49,340
Charming indeed.

804
00:41:52,780 --> 00:41:53,540
Third-Place Scholar,

805
00:41:54,700 --> 00:41:56,100
you come from a farming family,

806
00:41:57,220 --> 00:41:58,700
without a single official
among your relatives.

807
00:41:59,700 --> 00:42:02,900
That's even rarer than coming first
in the exams.

808
00:42:05,820 --> 00:42:06,660
Your Majesty is too kind.

809
00:42:08,340 --> 00:42:10,620
You were living as a farmer in Lingnan.

810
00:42:11,100 --> 00:42:12,300
Why come all the way to Sheng'an

811
00:42:13,020 --> 00:42:13,940
to take the imperial exams?

812
00:42:14,540 --> 00:42:15,100
Your Majesty,

813
00:42:15,540 --> 00:42:17,100
precisely because I am a commoner,

814
00:42:17,620 --> 00:42:18,540
born among the fields

815
00:42:18,780 --> 00:42:19,620
and raised in the countryside,

816
00:42:20,340 --> 00:42:21,500
with a life worth no more than dust,

817
00:42:21,900 --> 00:42:23,060
I sought a place in Your Majesty's court

818
00:42:23,620 --> 00:42:24,420
to serve the people

819
00:42:25,020 --> 00:42:25,820
and be of use to Your Majesty.

820
00:42:31,580 --> 00:42:32,460
Well said!

821
00:42:33,540 --> 00:42:35,020
All lands under heaven
belong to the Emperor.

822
00:42:35,580 --> 00:42:37,220
Even a talented man from distant Lingnan

823
00:42:37,620 --> 00:42:38,060
can still

824
00:42:38,820 --> 00:42:40,340
find his way into Father's service!

825
00:42:48,620 --> 00:42:50,620
Do you have a wife back home?

826
00:42:51,820 --> 00:42:52,380
Your Majesty,

827
00:42:53,060 --> 00:42:53,500
I do not.

828
00:42:54,580 --> 00:42:55,420
What do you think

829
00:42:56,740 --> 00:42:58,500
of my daughter, Princess Danyang?

830
00:43:07,820 --> 00:43:12,620
(Next Episode Preview)

831
00:43:12,860 --> 00:43:13,620
Third-Place Scholar,

832
00:43:14,540 --> 00:43:15,460
come to my residence

833
00:43:15,900 --> 00:43:17,100
and help me with a few questions.

834
00:43:17,300 --> 00:43:18,060
Forgive me, Your Highness.

835
00:43:18,740 --> 00:43:19,780
Isn't this the umbrella you gave him?

836
00:43:19,980 --> 00:43:20,660
Why did he leave it here?

837
00:43:21,420 --> 00:43:22,700
Do you know where Yan Shang went?

838
00:43:23,780 --> 00:43:24,900
He never breaks his promises.

839
00:43:25,020 --> 00:43:25,980
Where could he have gone?

840
00:43:29,241 --> 00:43:32,534
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

841
00:43:35,219 --> 00:43:40,135
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

842
00:43:42,329 --> 00:43:48,174
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

843
00:43:48,674 --> 00:43:53,900
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

844
00:43:56,669 --> 00:44:01,460
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

845
00:44:02,296 --> 00:44:08,375
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

846
00:44:10,176 --> 00:44:13,326
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

847
00:44:13,326 --> 00:44:14,974
♪Burning bright as a song♪

848
00:44:15,026 --> 00:44:18,750
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

849
00:44:19,128 --> 00:44:23,794
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

850
00:44:24,413 --> 00:44:28,454
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

851
00:44:28,945 --> 00:44:31,060
♪Not a single hour less♪

852
00:44:31,100 --> 00:44:38,046
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

853
00:44:38,809 --> 00:44:42,262
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

854
00:44:42,442 --> 00:44:45,587
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

855
00:44:46,026 --> 00:44:52,663
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

856
00:44:53,060 --> 00:44:55,098
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

857
00:44:55,098 --> 00:44:57,574
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

858
00:44:57,612 --> 00:45:00,081
♪You're the only one I need♪

859
00:45:00,285 --> 00:45:07,172
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

860
00:45:07,484 --> 00:45:10,755
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

861
00:45:11,060 --> 00:45:14,233
♪My last untouched innocence♪

862
00:45:14,557 --> 00:45:17,983
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

863
00:45:18,216 --> 00:45:21,441
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

864
00:45:21,772 --> 00:45:28,568
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

865
00:45:28,937 --> 00:45:30,999
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

866
00:45:31,000 --> 00:45:33,503
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

867
00:45:33,550 --> 00:45:35,888
♪You're the only one I need♪

868
00:45:36,119 --> 00:45:42,954
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

869
00:45:43,303 --> 00:45:44,921
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

870
00:45:45,051 --> 00:45:46,847
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

871
00:45:47,204 --> 00:45:50,221
♪You're the only one I need♪

872
00:45:50,261 --> 00:45:51,588
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)
